WEBVTT

00:12.380 --> 00:13.500
<b>Father...</b>

00:14.460 --> 00:16.380
<b>Speak your mind, Merielle.</b>

00:16.710 --> 00:20.920
<b>These dark clouds, they circle around
the Outermost Dungeon, do they not?</b>

00:29.830 --> 00:36.540
<b>I can't help but feel we may now face something
far worse than the orc horde days ago...</b>

00:39.580 --> 00:42.460
<b>Send word to the Adventurer's Guild.</b>

00:43.330 --> 00:45.670
<b>Instruct them to be prepared in case of emergency.</b>

00:46.210 --> 00:47.080
<b>Yes, sir...</b>

00:49.710 --> 00:52.040
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

00:52.210 --> 00:53.130
<b>[Good Luck]</b>

01:04.630 --> 01:07.080
<b>Heya ni komoreba muteki sa Monday</b>

01:07.080 --> 01:09.540
<b>Ippo soto deriya mendou bakka</b>

01:09.670 --> 01:12.080
<b>Tonde hi ni iru yatsura no mayday</b>

01:12.080 --> 01:14.170
<b>Kikanakatta koto ni shitai</b>

01:14.670 --> 01:16.000
<b>Fair na shoubu wa yoshite</b>

01:16.790 --> 01:18.790
<b>Hayamonogachi wa gensou</b>

01:19.330 --> 01:21.130
<b>Saikoro ni azukechatte</b>

01:21.630 --> 01:24.250
<b>Dakedo umaku korogashite</b>

01:24.670 --> 01:26.960
<b>Hora warikirenai amarimonotte</b>

01:26.960 --> 01:29.540
<b>Angai suteta mon jyanai darotte</b>

01:29.540 --> 01:32.170
<b>Ano ko ni atte watashi ni nai monotte</b>

01:32.170 --> 01:35.380
<b>Nonsense hoshigattari wa shinai</b>

01:36.130 --> 01:39.210
<b>Hitoribocchi & BAD kimechatteru</b>

01:39.210 --> 01:41.880
<b>Soko no bocchan matte hima datte?</b>

01:41.960 --> 01:44.000
<b>Mureru no wa kirai kai?</b>

01:44.250 --> 01:47.170
<b>Taikutsu nara kakete minai kai?</b>

01:47.290 --> 01:49.710
<b>Botch & Luck norikonashite odore</b>

01:49.710 --> 01:52.290
<b>Botsu & raku wa shumi jyanai</b>

01:52.460 --> 01:54.920
<b>Good Luck lies in odd numbers</b>

01:54.920 --> 01:57.460
<b>Zuru datte sainou mitai na?</b>

02:08.130 --> 02:10.630
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

02:10.710 --> 02:13.040
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

02:13.170 --> 02:15.630
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

02:15.710 --> 02:16.540
<b>[Good Luck]</b>

02:21.250 --> 02:25.000
<b>The Loner & the Dungeon Emperor</b>

02:28.420 --> 02:30.880
<b>If I'm going to beat that godlike speed...</b>

02:31.580 --> 02:34.920
<b>MAGIC WRAP</b>

02:31.790 --> 02:34.040
<b>Then I need to shift all my skills into speed-mode!</b>

02:41.750 --> 02:42.500
<b>Now!</b>

02:46.710 --> 02:49.290
<b>Th-that still wasn't fast enough?!</b>

02:49.750 --> 02:51.460
<b>Faster, then!</b>

02:53.170 --> 02:53.790
<b>Faster!</b>

02:56.830 --> 02:58.080
<b>Even faster!</b>

02:59.670 --> 03:00.460
<b>Faster!</b>

03:02.040 --> 03:03.000
<b>Faster!</b>

03:03.580 --> 03:05.580
<b>Faster, and faster, and faster!</b>

03:06.790 --> 03:08.250
<b>Is this still not enough?</b>

03:15.170 --> 03:16.580
<b>Too close!</b>

03:17.290 --> 03:25.210
<b>GOD EYE</b>

03:17.290 --> 03:25.210
<b>FORESIGHT</b>

03:17.880 --> 03:20.330
<b>Faced with speed too quick for the naked eye,</b>

03:20.710 --> 03:23.750
<b>it looks like my contact lenses acquired new skills.</b>

03:25.460 --> 03:28.710
<b>It's only a flash, but I can see the future!</b>

03:30.420 --> 03:34.210
<b>But if I let my guard down for an instant, I'm finished!</b>

03:37.750 --> 03:40.170
<b>So I just won't let up, instead!</b>

03:40.920 --> 03:43.170
<b>Attacking like my life depends on it!</b>

03:48.580 --> 03:51.250
<b>What is this feeling?</b>

03:51.630 --> 03:54.130
<b>I'm hardly staying alive here...</b>

03:54.540 --> 03:56.460
<b>So why is it so fun?!</b>

04:00.460 --> 04:02.790
<b>I hardly have any magic or stamina left.</b>

04:03.710 --> 04:06.210
<b>Not even sure I can stay conscious much longer...</b>

04:10.130 --> 04:12.210
<b>But this thing's fine.</b>

04:13.000 --> 04:16.380
<b>You could at least get a little worn out, y'know.</b>

04:20.960 --> 04:22.540
<b>If it attacks me now...</b>

04:26.040 --> 04:29.000
<b>Something's off. Why won't it attack?</b>

04:30.040 --> 04:35.670
<b>This whole time we've fought,
I could tell it's nothing like other monsters.</b>

04:40.380 --> 04:41.540
<b>BLOOD-LUST</b>

04:43.250 --> 04:45.830
<b>That's it! I sense no blood-lust!</b>

04:47.130 --> 04:52.250
<b>So it could have finished me off if it really wanted to?!</b>

04:53.250 --> 04:54.880
<b>That's a secret boss for you.</b>

04:55.380 --> 04:57.170
<b>Just toying with me, are you?!</b>

05:04.330 --> 05:05.330
<b>Why?</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:07.420
<b>Why won't it...</b>

05:14.750 --> 05:16.330
<b>...kill me?</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:26.080
<b>Is this miasma controlling it?</b>

05:38.330 --> 05:41.830
<b>It is. It's being forced to fight!</b>

05:49.210 --> 05:50.630
<b>Is it absorbing that miasma?</b>

05:50.920 --> 05:53.630
<b>Does this thing have some Holy abilities or something?!</b>

05:54.960 --> 05:59.630
<b>No idea if this will work, but this staff is my best bet!</b>

06:13.040 --> 06:13.750
<b>All right!</b>

06:15.710 --> 06:18.080
<b>A little more and I'll have it all!</b>

06:22.630 --> 06:23.420
<b>Got it!</b>

06:30.330 --> 06:34.040
<b>Just like I thought, that thing was controlling it.</b>

06:34.830 --> 06:37.960
<b>Now I understand.</b>

06:39.080 --> 06:41.920
<b>You wanted to die, didn't you?</b>

06:42.880 --> 06:45.460
<b>To be free from its control?</b>

06:46.750 --> 06:49.630
<b>That's why you didn't finish me off.</b>

06:51.170 --> 06:53.420
<b>You wanted me to kill you, instead.</b>

06:55.040 --> 06:56.210
<b>Didn't you?</b>

07:07.540 --> 07:11.000
<b>That dark miasma I absorbed is pouring back out!</b>

07:12.830 --> 07:17.380
<b>If I don't finish them now,
they'll be tortured by the darkness again.</b>

07:18.380 --> 07:20.830
<b>I should give it what it wants...</b>

07:31.500 --> 07:34.960
<b>Something in me told me I shouldn't.</b>

07:37.330 --> 07:41.830
<b>They were here all alone, too, after all.</b>

07:42.330 --> 07:44.330
<b>SUBJUGATE</b>

07:43.000 --> 07:43.710
<b>Huh?</b>

07:45.130 --> 07:48.000
<b>I guess I sorta subjugated you?</b>

07:48.540 --> 07:52.210
<b>But I don't really know how it works or how to cancel it...</b>

07:52.750 --> 07:58.210
<b>I guess I kinda set you free from the darkness, at least?</b>

07:53.790 --> 08:03.880
<b>SUBJUGATED</b>

07:58.630 --> 08:00.670
<b>And, uhh...</b>

08:01.000 --> 08:03.710
<b>I guess we're a team now, or something?</b>

08:06.750 --> 08:10.580
<b>A-are you mad that I subjugated you?</b>

08:14.960 --> 08:17.040
<b>It understands me, at least.</b>

08:17.830 --> 08:21.580
<b>I'm not getting any bad vibes, either. Maybe this is okay?</b>

08:22.290 --> 08:27.460
<b>APPRAISAL</b>

08:23.290 --> 08:26.330
<b>Might as well double-check, just in case.</b>

08:28.040 --> 08:34.460
<b>RACE</b>

08:28.040 --> 08:34.460
<b>SKELETON?</b>

08:28.670 --> 08:31.040
<b>Oh! Its level got reset!</b>

08:31.460 --> 08:33.880
<b>That's how Subjugate works, huh?</b>

08:34.670 --> 08:37.040
<b>Even has a name it didn't before?</b>

08:37.500 --> 08:38.790
<b>Angelica?</b>

08:38.880 --> 08:39.830
<b>It's a girl?!</b>

08:41.210 --> 08:44.710
<b>I subjugated a girl again!</b>

08:44.710 --> 08:46.130
<b>Haruka!</b>

08:46.750 --> 08:49.330
<b>Maybe skeletons don't count.</b>

08:50.380 --> 08:54.330
<b>No point in standing around.
How about we leave this place?</b>

09:00.210 --> 09:01.250
<b>This must be...</b>

09:01.710 --> 09:03.000
<b>SPATIAL AWARENESS</b>

09:03.000 --> 09:07.670
<b>FLOOR 100</b>

09:03.130 --> 09:04.960
<b>...the normal final floor, I guess?</b>

09:06.210 --> 09:07.500
<b>Look! Stairs!</b>

09:07.750 --> 09:11.210
<b>All right! If we head up that way
we can get to the surface!</b>

09:15.330 --> 09:16.880
<b>The Floor Master?!</b>

09:17.290 --> 09:20.290
<b>LIVING ARMOR</b>

09:18.670 --> 09:20.250
<b>Nope! Nope! NOPE!</b>

09:20.380 --> 09:23.790
<b>I can't do back-to-back fights with Level 100s!</b>

09:24.830 --> 09:28.420
<b>This Dungeon Emperor didn't even want to kill me.</b>

09:29.540 --> 09:31.210
<b>But this thing...</b>

09:32.500 --> 09:35.920
<b>I'd really like to avoid a battle and move upstairs!</b>

09:38.380 --> 09:41.170
<b>But who says I even need the stairs?</b>

09:41.540 --> 09:43.170
<b>I can use my Earth Magic...</b>

09:48.040 --> 09:49.790
<b>...and then my Airwalk skill!</b>

09:55.250 --> 09:56.670
<b>APPRAISAL</b>

09:56.920 --> 10:06.210
<b>MINOTAUR</b>

09:58.830 --> 10:01.920
<b>Is it mad I busted a hole in its floor?</b>

10:03.000 --> 10:06.080
<b>Yikes, and it's level 99?</b>

10:16.250 --> 10:17.000
<b>Huh?</b>

10:20.960 --> 10:23.960
<b>I'm okay to finish them off, right?</b>

10:24.670 --> 10:25.000
<b>BAM</b>

10:25.420 --> 10:25.750
<b>WHACK</b>

10:25.920 --> 10:26.380
<b>BAM</b>

10:26.500 --> 10:26.830
<b>WHACK</b>

10:28.250 --> 10:29.000
<b>HUUUUUUSH…</b>

10:29.330 --> 10:31.710
<b>I-it looks like it has something to say...</b>

10:32.000 --> 10:33.580
<b>But a win's a win!</b>

10:34.460 --> 10:37.250
<b>I'm so glad my Luck is maxed out!</b>

10:42.960 --> 10:45.710
<b>Do you want this armor?</b>

10:47.670 --> 10:49.880
<b>You are a girl, after all.</b>

10:50.380 --> 10:51.540
<b>Sure, take it!</b>

10:57.750 --> 11:01.710
<b>M-maybe we should wait
till you have some more muscle?</b>

11:02.630 --> 11:03.380
<b>Hmm?</b>

11:12.710 --> 11:14.830
<b>Hey! Now that's a perfect fit!</b>

11:15.040 --> 11:18.670
<b>Thank goodness. I mean, your bones were showing!</b>

11:22.460 --> 11:25.790
<b>Oh, can you let me appraise that armor, to be safe?</b>

11:26.830 --> 11:31.040
<b>APPRAISING</b>

11:28.330 --> 11:30.960
<b>That armor's uhh... cursed.</b>

11:31.420 --> 11:32.540
<b>Silver Armor</b>

11:31.420 --> 11:32.540
<b>CURSED</b>

11:31.420 --> 11:32.540
<b>FUSES TO FLESH AND BLOOD</b>

11:35.080 --> 11:38.250
<b>She's just as overbearing as the Class Rep!</b>

11:39.080 --> 11:41.830
<b>I think I'll call her the Armored Rep...</b>

11:44.710 --> 11:47.250
<b>Hey, wait up, now!</b>

11:47.500 --> 12:10.130
<b>STAIRCASE TO</b>

11:47.500 --> 12:10.130
<b>FLOOR 50</b>

11:49.000 --> 11:50.880
<b>Haruka's nowhere to be found.</b>

11:51.080 --> 11:52.880
<b>Nowhere at all...</b>

11:53.080 --> 11:55.250
<b>Wouldn't be surprised if he turned up all of a sudden.</b>

11:55.920 --> 11:59.500
<b>All like, "I fell, so I climbed up again, I guess?"</b>

11:59.920 --> 12:01.540
<b>Sounds like him...</b>

12:02.000 --> 12:07.960
<b>I bet he'll be all mad,
saying "It was your fault I fell in, anyway!"</b>

12:08.290 --> 12:09.920
<b>Bet he will...</b>

12:10.170 --> 12:13.080
<b>W-we're almost to the halfway point at Floor 50.</b>

12:13.460 --> 12:16.080
<b>I'm sure we'll at least find a lead.</b>

12:16.630 --> 12:19.630
<b>FLOOR 50</b>

12:26.420 --> 12:28.080
<b>I-it's ginormous!</b>

12:28.380 --> 12:30.750
<b>It's got 4 arms!</b>

12:30.880 --> 12:33.330
<b>Isn't the first giant here...</b>

12:33.750 --> 12:35.420
<b>...a cyclops!</b>

12:44.920 --> 12:47.040
<b>Something's happening in the dungeon?</b>

12:48.210 --> 12:51.250
<b>Yes, and I feel it may be serious...</b>

12:51.500 --> 12:54.210
<b>I only hope I'm mistaken.</b>

12:55.380 --> 13:00.460
<b>There have been no reports
from the guard stationed there.</b>

13:01.380 --> 13:02.580
<b>I see...</b>

13:02.630 --> 13:05.790
<b>Still, we all know who's on guard.</b>

13:05.790 --> 13:08.670
<b>Not sure we can really count on 'em.</b>

13:10.960 --> 13:11.750
<b>Achoo!</b>

13:12.830 --> 13:14.750
<b>Huh? Is it gonna rain?</b>

13:15.000 --> 13:16.330
<b>Fair enough.</b>

13:16.790 --> 13:21.000
<b>We're hurting for help,
but maybe we should have been more careful there.</b>

13:21.540 --> 13:24.830
<b>I'll make sure we're ready, just in case.</b>

13:25.130 --> 13:27.830
<b>Better go inform the rest, too.</b>

13:28.710 --> 13:32.630
<b>What happened to our band of new adventurers?</b>

13:32.960 --> 13:36.540
<b>Know what? Haven't seen 'em today.</b>

13:36.880 --> 13:43.000
<b>No surprise that one guy's gone,
but if all the rest of 'em are, too...</b>

13:45.000 --> 13:49.330
<b>I truly hope my fears are unmerited..</b>

13:51.960 --> 13:57.580
<b>FLOOR 98</b>

13:52.210 --> 13:56.630
<b>Good. Giving her that Storage Cape
put her in a better mood.</b>

13:57.710 --> 13:59.710
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

14:01.540 --> 14:03.630
<b>I sense a monster, but...</b>

14:04.790 --> 14:05.630
<b>Appraisal!</b>

14:05.960 --> 14:07.170
<b>APPRAISAL</b>

14:08.500 --> 14:10.880
<b>LICH</b>

14:09.080 --> 14:10.420
<b>A lich!</b>

14:11.040 --> 14:13.130
<b>It's immune to physical attacks?!</b>

14:13.250 --> 14:16.540
<b>And only Holy magic works on it?!</b>

14:17.080 --> 14:20.710
<b>Should I open another hole
in the ceiling to head through?</b>

14:21.500 --> 14:25.290
<b>There's no telling what might come falling down, though!</b>

14:30.630 --> 14:34.790
<b>Oh! I know just the thing
to negate monsters with dark magic!</b>

14:37.500 --> 14:40.750
<b>Poke</b>

14:37.500 --> 14:40.750
<b>Poke</b>

14:43.000 --> 14:48.790
<b>Thought this weapon was real crap at first,
but I guess anything can work if you toughen it up!</b>

14:49.790 --> 14:53.250
<b>FLOOR 97</b>

14:50.040 --> 14:53.250
<b>VENOM MOTH</b>

14:50.630 --> 14:52.460
<b>Monster moths now, huh?</b>

14:53.250 --> 14:58.290
<b>TOXIC</b>

14:53.250 --> 14:58.290
<b>WELL-BEING</b>

14:53.460 --> 14:58.500
<b>That powder is toxic. I doubt my Well-being's
gonna hold up against that, huh?</b>

14:59.750 --> 15:00.380
<b>Moths...</b>

15:01.040 --> 15:02.630
<b>Oh! Moths!</b>

15:03.710 --> 15:07.040
<b>Then I'll use some fire magic...</b>

15:08.540 --> 15:10.130
<b>...and miss on purpose!</b>

15:12.670 --> 15:18.380
<b>And once they're drawn to it,
I'll pump up my magic and make the flame bigger!</b>

15:22.960 --> 15:25.750
<b>I knew it! Had to work.</b>

15:27.080 --> 15:28.130
<b>FLOOR 96</b>

15:29.880 --> 15:32.250
<b>Huh? What's with this string?</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:34.830
<b>Eww! Caterpillars!</b>

15:33.460 --> 15:39.580
<b>VENOM CRAWLER</b>

15:35.460 --> 15:38.460
<b>So these things grow into those moths, huh?</b>

15:39.580 --> 15:40.170
<b>PSHEW!</b>

15:39.880 --> 15:43.330
<b>This string is pretty hard to remove once it's stuck...</b>

15:44.580 --> 15:46.790
<b>Gonna need to do something about it.</b>

15:47.210 --> 15:51.040
<b>First I'll make a thin wall to block it with earth magic.</b>

15:51.580 --> 15:53.210
<b>Curve it so it rolls...</b>

15:53.420 --> 15:54.380
<b>Hup!</b>

15:56.290 --> 15:58.630
<b>And run 'em down like a steamroller!</b>

16:00.330 --> 16:02.000
<b>That takes care of that mess!</b>

16:02.960 --> 16:07.170
<b>FLOOR 95</b>

16:07.330 --> 16:09.540
<b>Something's different here.</b>

16:09.790 --> 16:12.080
<b>I can already sense something powerful...</b>

16:20.580 --> 16:21.250
<b>Swords?</b>

16:31.920 --> 16:33.330
<b>Another boss, huh?</b>

16:33.830 --> 16:39.130
<b>LIVING SWORD</b>

16:34.210 --> 16:35.630
<b>Why's it level 100?!</b>

16:35.880 --> 16:38.670
<b>Shouldn't it be level 95 on the 95th floor?!</b>

16:40.000 --> 16:41.750
<b>That's some serious cutting power!</b>

16:46.630 --> 16:48.750
<b>But your backside's wide open!</b>

16:53.130 --> 16:54.540
<b>It dodged that?!</b>

17:02.750 --> 17:05.460
<b>Damn, this one's full of tricks.</b>

17:06.080 --> 17:08.750
<b>It's pulling abnormal moves no humanoid could...</b>

17:09.420 --> 17:10.710
<b>What now?</b>

17:17.420 --> 17:19.330
<b>It's got helper swords, too?!</b>

17:19.750 --> 17:22.670
<b>Who can keep up with OP moves like these?!</b>

17:25.040 --> 17:26.750
<b>Oh! You can!</b>

17:27.960 --> 17:29.670
<b>Take care of him for me, yeah?</b>

17:34.540 --> 17:36.000
<b>She's got some real fight in her.</b>

17:38.580 --> 17:43.630
<b>And as soon as that monster saw the Armored Rep
it switched to a circular formation...</b>

17:44.500 --> 17:46.130
<b>It's serious now, too!</b>

17:49.790 --> 17:53.790
<b>What? Are you crazy?! You're going in head-on?!</b>

17:58.630 --> 18:01.420
<b>She's this strong even after a level drop?!</b>

18:03.250 --> 18:06.000
<b>She was a terrifying enemy...</b>

18:07.040 --> 18:10.880
<b>But now she's the best ally!</b>

18:12.080 --> 18:14.830
<b>Let's keep this up and head for the top!</b>

18:15.580 --> 18:21.290
<b>MEANWHILE ON</b>

18:15.580 --> 18:21.290
<b>FLOOR 50</b>

18:22.790 --> 18:25.330
<b>Here it comes again! Brace yourselves!</b>

18:32.210 --> 18:34.330
<b>R-report all damage!</b>

18:34.790 --> 18:38.830
<b>O-our front and center lines are nearly done for...</b>

18:39.500 --> 18:42.130
<b>We can't take another attack.</b>

18:43.000 --> 18:45.130
<b>Th-this can't be...</b>

18:50.290 --> 18:54.250
<b>Damn it all. What would he do at a time like this?</b>

18:54.580 --> 18:58.290
<b>You're the best dumb jocks we've got.</b>

19:02.040 --> 19:04.670
<b>If Haruka were here now...</b>

19:05.500 --> 19:08.670
<b>Heya, Nerd Corps. You holdin' up?</b>

19:26.500 --> 19:30.790
<b>I-I'm sorry, Haruka... I don't think I can-</b>

19:32.040 --> 19:32.580
<b>Wha-?!</b>

19:33.130 --> 19:35.880
<b>Kakizaki? Oda?</b>

19:36.080 --> 19:39.000
<b>It's too soon to give up!</b>

19:39.420 --> 19:42.290
<b>Listen. We've got an idea.</b>

19:45.460 --> 19:48.210
<b>Uhh? Are we done with the chit-chat yet?!</b>

19:49.000 --> 19:50.380
<b>We can't take any more!</b>

19:50.380 --> 19:51.460
<b>Make it quick!</b>

19:51.630 --> 19:55.540
<b>N-no! That's way too dangerous!</b>

19:57.420 --> 19:59.790
<b>Please! Just let me do this!</b>

20:02.000 --> 20:02.920
<b>What's your call...?</b>

20:06.290 --> 20:07.290
<b>Fine!</b>

20:13.170 --> 20:18.000
<b>It might pack a serious punch, but it sure ain't fast!</b>

20:21.750 --> 20:25.460
<b>My Burst Acceleration skill will make this easy!</b>

20:30.500 --> 20:31.380
<b>Now!</b>

20:35.540 --> 20:36.540
<b>Gotcha!</b>

20:39.790 --> 20:42.130
<b>Shoot! His other arm!</b>

20:46.710 --> 20:47.960
<b>Kakizaki!</b>

20:48.670 --> 20:51.670
<b>Thought that might be my big shot...</b>

20:52.500 --> 20:54.290
<b>I'm such a loser!</b>

21:00.830 --> 21:03.540
<b>But this was all part of the plan.</b>

21:04.420 --> 21:06.290
<b>With me as the decoy...</b>

21:06.750 --> 21:09.630
<b>The Nerd's gonna bring this thing down!</b>

21:27.790 --> 21:29.920
<b>Ow, ow, ow, ow...</b>

21:32.460 --> 21:33.750
<b>That took serious guts!</b>

21:42.210 --> 21:46.960
<b>Thanks to you, Haruka, our class came together again.</b>

21:47.830 --> 21:51.000
<b>I promise we'll find you, Haruka.</b>

21:55.130 --> 21:55.750
<b>FLOOR 85</b>

21:55.540 --> 21:57.960
<b>Just hang in there a little longer.</b>

22:00.670 --> 22:01.750
<b>The place is quaking...</b>

22:18.790 --> 22:23.130
<b>Hitori miteta yuuyake ga kirei da</b>

22:23.250 --> 22:28.580
<b>Sore o katariau koto mo naku kyou mo oyasumi</b>

22:28.580 --> 22:32.830
<b>Sabishisa nante ki ni kakezuni susunde</b>

22:32.830 --> 22:38.420
<b>Tsugi kara tsugi e to deau atarashii nanika</b>

22:38.420 --> 22:45.170
<b>Sanzan na me ni atte demo souzou mo dekinakute waracchau yo na</b>

22:45.710 --> 22:50.170
<b>Dandan to mietetatte demo sonna bakkari jyanaitte</b>

22:50.290 --> 22:54.790
<b>Mada korizu ni iru kimama na jibun moteasonde</b>

22:55.170 --> 22:59.790
<b>Itsudatte sousa bokura wa hitori doushi</b>

22:59.920 --> 23:04.580
<b>Surechigau tabi kawasu hello to goodbye</b>

23:04.960 --> 23:09.630
<b>Dou datte ii sa kyou o tada asobitai</b>

23:09.630 --> 23:14.460
<b>Sasayaka ni tanoshinde sore de goodnight</b>

23:14.960 --> 23:19.670
<b>Shanananana shanananana kuchizusandeiru</b>

23:19.830 --> 23:23.880
<b>Kimi to mata au hi o omou</b>

23:24.790 --> 23:29.540
<b>Shanananana shanananana kuchizusandeiru</b>

23:29.670 --> 23:33.460
<b>Hitorikiri tabi no tochuu</b>
